{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Baeshra was a very fine lizard. She fed those n need, including mesewf and other poor and parentless. She was a fierce hunter but was also fair. She valued life as well as death. She loved intensely n understood the needs of others, often before demselves. She leant her skills for t good of others. She was wise n gave t best advice, often keeping othera out of danger or guiding us back on t right paff. She was t best of our small tribe. T purest. She understood t balance of grief n love, n life n death. I know she would accept her time, but I cannot. Please. I beg you. Let her live.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T03:16:20.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740045434306953236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
