{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"O, this soul is an innocent. While she may have acted animalistic in nature, she knew how ta be nuturin ta all those among us. So much so tha she cared an loved this one.\" Kiln pulls Web forward. \"Please give this'n back tha one they love. I'll give what I must as yer one o yer acolytes. I jus ask ye help this wee one.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T03:28:38.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740048527849291836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"An if ye can't ye can go an fack yeself.\" Kiln grins at Osiris.","created_at":"2020-08-04T03:29:07.008000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740048647521173554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods thankfully at Kiln","created_at":"2020-08-04T03:29:17.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740048692987428916","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"'Baeshra was one of the kindest people I have ever known. She was everything to me. She wanted to be the Apex predator, to be a wise elder with much honor. She was... she was kind. She cared for her tribe, her family. She wanted to protect us all. She was a gentle mother figure, yet fierce when she needed to be. She cared about honoring all of the parts of her kills, about making sure that every person she met or knew was honored. She worried about her mistakes, but did not dwell on them so much as to forget the present. She was wishing for a happy future the night and morning before she died. I ask that you treat her kindly, for she deserved it. I loved her. I still do. And I would give anything to see she is treated the best she can.'","created_at":"2020-08-04T03:29:26.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740048728580423694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
